{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can You Pass a Spy Agency\u2019s Interview Demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the enigmatic world of Agent of Veil in this exclusive demo where you'll have a sneak peek into a world of puzzles, peculiar questions, and a few too many locked drawers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739870/extras/solve_puzzles.png?t=1747329296\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a series of carefully crafted challenges designed to test your wit, logic, and readiness for espionage. From quirky spy interview questions to clever puzzles, each task brings you one step closer to proving you have what it takes to join the agency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739870/extras/demo_puzzle.png?t=1747329296\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye out! This demo includes a special puzzle available only here, never to appear in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">colorful design</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">hint system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">isometric view for easy travel</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">special puzzle only available in demo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739870?t=1747329296","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739870/b308ae50dd4188b3bf9cb892ac5ce2b0f0eeaea3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747329296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st